<title>EGYPT: Kabo end-Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Kabo end-Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available):</p>
<p>Net sales			   103,165,000</p>
<p>Production costs		   84,897,000</p>
<p>Net profit/loss before tax    +18,268,000</p>
<p>(Full company name is Kabo/Nasr Clothing and Textiles).</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
